{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29170","headline":"夜归孤山寺却寄卢郎中 · 许浑","name":"夜归孤山寺却寄卢郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"青山有志路犹赊，心在琴书自忆家。\n醉别庾楼山色晓，夜归萧寺月光斜。\n落帆露湿回塘柳，别院风惊满地花。\n他日此身须报德，莫言空爱旧烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29170.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29170","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}